  "adaptations": [
    "Propagate hook initialization and registration errors with reverse rollback",
    "Compare syscall and LSM slot ownership inside stop_machine before restoration",
    "Guard and drain dispatched and direct syscall callbacks before rollback",
    "Retain LKM callback provider until reboot; quarantine failed restoration without freeing callback state",
    "Export GPL xkcnsu_root_api_get for symbol_get-pinned guard consumers",
    "Port Next AVC feature 10003 with XKCNSU domain, live BTF validation, failure readback and shared SUSFS service"
  ],
